        "original_id": "8340109f-4cdb-5dd7-825f-19e35083f433",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Ferrero SpA\n- Products: Nutella\n- People: Pietro Ferrero\n- Places: Alba, Piedmont, Italy\n- Topics: chocolate and confectionery\n\nFacts:\n- Ferrero SpA was founded in 1946 in Alba, Piedmont, Italy, by Pietro Ferrero.\n- Pietro Ferrero was a confectioner and small-time pastry maker who added hazelnut to save money on chocolate and laid the groundwork for Nutella.\n- Ferrero SpA is an Italian manufacturer of branded chocolate and confectionery products.\n- Ferrero SpA is the third biggest chocolate producer and confectionery company in the world.\n- Nutella is a brand of sweetened hazelnut cocoa spread manufactured by the Italian company Ferrero.\n- The first iteration of Nutella dates to 1963.\n- Nutella was first introduced in 1965.",
